{"id":946720,"shortDescription":"To The Rescue! es un simulador de gestión de un refugio canino. Cuida de perros únicos y búscales un buen hogar a todos los que puedas. Mejora tu centro, frena enfermedades, conoce las preferencias de cada perro y toma decisiones difíciles. ¡Y todo ello ayudando también a refugios del mundo real!","developers":["Little Rock Games","indie.io"],"publishers":["indie.io"],"categories":["Un jugador","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"2 NOV 2021","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795026201","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_96179024f52ed69f23d4a62b45261045d3f0c987.600x338.jpg?t=1795026201","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_96179024f52ed69f23d4a62b45261045d3f0c987.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795026201"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_1b27e764802c70700000d1d477c76eb53fea5b56.600x338.jpg?t=1795026201","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_1b27e764802c70700000d1d477c76eb53fea5b56.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795026201"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_72ef332a76e728632fc65c716c7de175d42ef33a.600x338.jpg?t=1795026201","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_72ef332a76e728632fc65c716c7de175d42ef33a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795026201"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_1266ffc5532bf0ea9a5dba5f106241ddc4b8c462.600x338.jpg?t=1795026201","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_1266ffc5532bf0ea9a5dba5f106241ddc4b8c462.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795026201"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/946720/ss_d45322ec20ef3df441be